Um, remember I have, uh,

01:12:55.890 --> 01:12:58.140
probability of X_1, um,

01:12:58.140 --> 01:13:08.060
[NOISE] probability of X_2 given X_1, um. [NOISE]

01:13:08.060 --> 01:13:10.820
So this might look like more, ah,

